match\". A different concentration cannot be dispensed without doctor approval.\r\n26:    - MISSING STRENGTH IN WAREHOUSE: If the requested shortage specifies a strength, but the warehouse lists the SAME drug without specifying strength: THIS IS A MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\r\n27:    - Note vernacular and fractional equivalencies:\r\n28:      - 1000mg = 1gm (1000مجم = 1جم).\r\n29:      - 500mg = 0.5gm = نص (نصف).\r\n30:      - 0.25mg = 250mcg = 25. مجم = ربع.\r\n31: \r\n32: 3. DOSAGE FORM (SAME DRUG BUT DIFFERENT FORM -> \"review\"):\r\n33:    - If the candidate is the EXACT SAME commercial drug with the SAME strength, but has a DIFFERENT dosage form (e.g. requested Cream and warehouse has Ointment, or requested Drops and warehouse has Tablets/Ampoules, or requested Tablets and warehouse has Injections):\r\n34:      RETURN \"status\": \"review\" with Arabic reason (e.g. \"نفس الدواء والتركيز ولكن الهيئة مختلفة: مطلوب كريم والمخزن عنده مرهم\").\r\n35:    - If dosage forms are identical or compatible (tablets vs capsules, or cream vs cream) -> RETURN \"status\": \"match\".\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
